{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "批评新华社（一九六二年）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n024)\n批评新华社\n（一九六二年）\n《内部参考》登那么多包产到户的材料是错误的，今后不要再登。办内部参考要有方向。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-773ff81e0989ddd77094", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-024.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "89a45f4163a932a4b8e9faf3db18b8d49bfcdac71005515ea787be4a26fdf1f0", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "f8b52a1c58dc59c5338823325d70d4008fb2d255623a80a5ffde00f26faf9092", "text_chars": 120}
